Q","review_id":"Yj9_ALhJSsFBSKNWtLPhrw","date":"2013-03-12T19:35:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9406572580337524,"text_excerpt":"My bar 635 is a good place to go for live music. No cover with a one drink minimum (not a problem LOL). They also have a small dance floor complete with a colorful characters jumping and dancing about. Later on It started getting a little to crowded so we moved upstairs. The upstairs was very nice, more of an upscale but comfortable feel. Plus the drinks are cheaper. We ended up sitting out on the balcony, a great place for people watching. Cool little bar."},{"business_id":"Rbjt0lAkzV7qv_H-5WYQPQ","review_id":"1--2nSC5h2Dn8t0iHChyTA","date":"2015-01-02T06:46:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307699203491211,"text_excerpt":"This is a great bar located right in the heart of Bourbon St, I mean smack dab in the middle of the fray lol. This bar has one of the coolest vibes of all the bars in the immediate area. There was a live band just pumpin out great music and the scene was definitely lively. People jumping around doing crazy dances etc... Quite the people watching experience. Head up the stairs near the band's stage and you'll find yourself in the upstairs bar, which is a bit quieter, but is fully stocked and ready to serve you. Had a daiquiri and a Redd's apple ale (guilty pleasure) and went to their beautiful balcony to take advantage of people watching from a higher vantage point. This is a great bar, a ..."},{"business_id":"Rbjt0lAkzV7qv_H-5WYQPQ","review_id":"N18ELDLBTiqY2UBUFo8xRA","date":"2014-03-10T23:54:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9292967915534973,"text_excerpt":"Cool little spot off of Bourbon street. Live music, good drinks and a nice crowd. It had an upstairs area that was nice too. Worth popping in here to see what's cracking."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Rbjt0lAkzV7qv_H-5WYQPQ","photo_id":"Xk1QXxCXp-a_1Sq_njTP_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Xk1QXxCXp-a_1Sq_njTP_w.jpg","visual_repre